{"seq":1,"slug":"chinese","title":"九年级语文","stage":"DONE","chapterCount":3,"docCount":9,"url":"/l-doc-books/education/middle-school/grade-9/chinese","introHtml":"<h1 id=\"九年级语文-简介\">九年级语文 简介</h1><p>九年级语文是初中语文学习的冲刺阶段，核心任务是<strong>把三年所学整合为可在考场稳定输出的应试能力</strong>。这一年不再是&quot;学新知识&quot;，而是围绕中考语文核心考点做系统复习与实战打磨，在巩固阅读、写作能力的同时对古诗文进行全面梳理。本 hub 严格对标《义务教育语文课程标准（2022 年版）》的六大学习任务群（来源：教育部，moe.gov.cn）。</p>\n<h2 id=\"本-hub-的定位-与兄弟-hub-的分工\">本 hub 的定位：与兄弟 hub 的分工</h2><p>义务教育语文是一条贯通九年的主线，各年级 hub 各司其职，本 hub 是其&quot;应试收口&quot;环节：</p>\n<table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>阶段 hub</th>\n<th>定位</th>\n<th>与本 hub 的关系</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>七年级语文（<a href=\"../../grade-7/chinese/classical-chinese/classical-vocabulary\">文言词汇</a>）</td>\n<td>入门：基础阅读、写作起步、文言启蒙</td>\n<td>提供文言实词等基础</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>八年级语文（<a href=\"../../grade-8/chinese/literary-analysis/\">文学作品分析</a>·<a href=\"../../grade-8/chinese/advanced-writing/\">进阶写作</a>·<a href=\"../../grade-8/chinese/classical-literature/\">古典文学</a>）</td>\n<td>进阶：文体分析、谋篇布局、整本书阅读</td>\n<td>提供文体与写作的进阶能力</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td><strong>九年级语文（本 hub）</strong></td>\n<td><strong>冲刺：中考考点复习 + 应试技法 + 古诗文总复习</strong></td>\n<td><strong>整合前两年，转化为应试得分力</strong></td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>高中语文（<a href=\"../../../high-school/year-1/chinese/modern-literature/\">现代文学</a>·<a href=\"../../../high-school/year-1/chinese/classical-literature/\">文言文学</a>·<a href=\"../../../high-school/year-1/chinese/writing-composition/\">写作训练</a>）</td>\n<td>提升：群文阅读、任务驱动写作、文学鉴赏</td>\n<td>本 hub 是其前置衔接</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<p><strong>与八年级语文 hub 的边界</strong>：八年级重&quot;学会分析单篇、写好一篇文章&quot;；本 hub 重&quot;在限时考场内精准踩分&quot;——同样讲赏析，八年级讲方法本身，本 hub 讲答题模板与采点规范。两者互补，不重复。</p>\n<h2 id=\"三章结构与内容\">三章结构与内容</h2><p>本 hub 含三章，对应中考语文三大得分板块：</p>\n<pre class=\"mermaid\" data-diagram-type=\"flowchart\" data-source=\"flowchart LR&#10;  A[九年级语文·中考冲刺] --&gt; B[一·中考阅读]&#10;  A --&gt; C[二·中考写作]&#10;  A --&gt; D[三·古文复习]&#10;  B --&gt; B1[现代文阅读:记叙/说明]&#10;  B --&gt; B2[议论文阅读]&#10;  B --&gt; B3[综合阅读:非连续性文本]&#10;  C --&gt; C1[命题作文]&#10;  C --&gt; C2[材料作文]&#10;  C --&gt; C3[半命题作文]&#10;  D --&gt; D1[文言文翻译]&#10;  D --&gt; D2[文言文分析]&#10;  D --&gt; D3[诗词鉴赏]\">flowchart LR\n  A[九年级语文·中考冲刺] --&gt; B[一·中考阅读]\n  A --&gt; C[二·中考写作]\n  A --&gt; D[三·古文复习]\n  B --&gt; B1[现代文阅读:记叙/说明]\n  B --&gt; B2[议论文阅读]\n  B --&gt; B3[综合阅读:非连续性文本]\n  C --&gt; C1[命题作文]\n  C --&gt; C2[材料作文]\n  C --&gt; C3[半命题作文]\n  D --&gt; D1[文言文翻译]\n  D --&gt; D2[文言文分析]\n  D --&gt; D3[诗词鉴赏]</pre><ul>\n<li>第一章 <strong><a href=\"exam-reading/\">中考阅读</a></strong>：<a href=\"exam-reading/modern-prose\">现代文阅读</a>（记叙文/散文/说明文）、<a href=\"exam-reading/argumentative-reading\">议论文阅读</a>、<a href=\"exam-reading/comprehensive-reading\">综合阅读</a>（非连续性文本、多文本、整本书），覆盖中考全部阅读文体的读法与答题规范。</li>\n<li>第二章 <strong><a href=\"exam-writing/\">中考写作</a></strong>：<a href=\"exam-writing/topic-essay\">命题作文</a>、<a href=\"exam-writing/material-essay\">材料作文</a>、<a href=\"exam-writing/semi-open-essay\">半命题作文</a>，三种题型共享结构与语言方法，差异在审题入口。</li>\n<li>第三章 <strong><a href=\"classical-review/\">古文复习</a></strong>：<a href=\"classical-review/classical-translation\">文言文翻译</a>（基础）、<a href=\"classical-review/classical-analysis\">文言文分析</a>（进阶）、<a href=\"classical-review/poetry-review\">诗词鉴赏</a>（平行板块）。</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"前置知识与推荐学习路径\">前置知识与推荐学习路径</h2><p><strong>前置</strong>：本 hub 默认已掌握八年级的文体分析与文言基础。文言实词若薄弱，先回顾 <a href=\"../../grade-7/chinese/classical-chinese/classical-vocabulary\">七年级文言词汇</a>；文体读法若不牢，先看 <a href=\"../../grade-8/chinese/literary-analysis/\">八年级文学作品分析</a>。</p>\n<p><strong>推荐顺序</strong>（三轮复习法）：</p>\n<ol>\n<li><strong>第一轮·分专题打基础</strong>：按&quot;阅读 → 写作 → 古文&quot;逐章学透方法，每个专题配限时练习。阅读先 <a href=\"exam-reading/modern-prose\">现代文</a> 再 <a href=\"exam-reading/argumentative-reading\">议论文</a> 后 <a href=\"exam-reading/comprehensive-reading\">综合阅读</a>；古文先 <a href=\"classical-review/classical-translation\">翻译</a>（读懂）再 <a href=\"classical-review/classical-analysis\">分析</a>（鉴赏），<a href=\"classical-review/poetry-review\">诗词鉴赏</a> 可平行进行。</li>\n<li><strong>第二轮·真题实战</strong>：用本省近三年中考真题限时训练，对照参考答案统计&quot;采点&quot;漏项。</li>\n<li><strong>第三轮·查漏补缺</strong>：针对失分专题回看方法篇，重点突破。</li>\n</ol>\n<p>写作要持续建素材库（<a href=\"exam-writing/topic-essay.md#素材库考前的弹药\">命题作文·素材库</a> 与 <a href=\"exam-reading/argumentative-reading\">议论文·论据库</a> 共用一套）；古诗文背诵默写要做到不增字、不漏字、不写错别字。</p>\n<h2 id=\"适用对象\">适用对象</h2><p>本 hub 适合备战中考的九年级学生系统复习，也可供教师做中考复习教学参考。</p>\n<blockquote>\n<p>课标依据：教育部《义务教育语文课程标准（2022 年版）》六大学习任务群（moe.gov.cn）。</p>\n</blockquote>\n","chapters":[{"seq":1,"slug":"exam-reading","title":"考试阅读","docCount":3,"url":"/l-doc-books/education/middle-school/grade-9/chinese/exam-reading","docs":[{"seq":1,"slug":"modern-prose","title":"九年级语文 — 现代文阅读","url":"/l-doc-books/education/middle-school/grade-9/chinese/exam-reading/modern-prose"},{"seq":2,"slug":"argumentative-reading","title":"九年级语文 — 议论文阅读","url":"/l-doc-books/education/middle-school/grade-9/chinese/exam-reading/argumentative-reading"},{"seq":3,"slug":"comprehensive-reading","title":"九年级语文 — 综合阅读","url":"/l-doc-books/education/middle-school/grade-9/chinese/exam-reading/comprehensive-reading"}]},{"seq":2,"slug":"exam-writing","title":"考试写作","docCount":3,"url":"/l-doc-books/education/middle-school/grade-9/chinese/exam-writing","docs":[{"seq":1,"slug":"topic-essay","title":"九年级语文 — 命题作文","url":"/l-doc-books/education/middle-school/grade-9/chinese/exam-writing/topic-essay"},{"seq":2,"slug":"material-essay","title":"九年级语文 — 材料作文","url":"/l-doc-books/education/middle-school/grade-9/chinese/exam-writing/material-essay"},{"seq":3,"slug":"semi-open-essay","title":"九年级语文 — 半命题作文","url":"/l-doc-books/education/middle-school/grade-9/chinese/exam-writing/semi-open-essay"}]},{"seq":3,"slug":"classical-review","title":"文言文复习","docCount":3,"url":"/l-doc-books/education/middle-school/grade-9/chinese/classical-review","docs":[{"seq":1,"slug":"classical-translation","title":"九年级语文 — 文言文翻译","url":"/l-doc-books/education/middle-school/grade-9/chinese/classical-review/classical-translation"},{"seq":2,"slug":"classical-analysis","title":"九年级语文 — 文言文分析","url":"/l-doc-books/education/middle-school/grade-9/chinese/classical-review/classical-analysis"},{"seq":3,"slug":"poetry-review","title":"九年级语文 — 诗词鉴赏复习","url":"/l-doc-books/education/middle-school/grade-9/chinese/classical-review/poetry-review"}]}]}